# Line endings are normalised to LF in the repository and in every
# working copy. Without this, a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true)
# gets CRLF files that `prettier --check` rejects on sight — every file,
# every run — which made `npm run format:check` unusable locally while
# passing in CI on Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary-ish assets that must never be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
